{"method":{"methodHash":"b9151bac2ed563fb2861f0633521c242","typeHash":"2ff0f7518314a60157c7b3e895ccc73d","name":"SetPanelVisibility","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/UISections/SettingsMenuControl.xaml.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":109,"startColumn":9,"endLine":120,"endColumn":10},"calls":[]},"lines":["        private void SetPanelVisibility(StackPanel panel, bool isVisible)","        {","            foreach (UIElement child in panel.Children)","            {","                // Keep titles, spacers, and bottom rectangles always visible","                bool shouldStayVisible = child is ATitle || child is ASpacer || child is ARectangleBottom;","","                child.Visibility = shouldStayVisible","                    ? Visibility.Visible","                    : (isVisible ? Visibility.Visible : Visibility.Collapsed);","            }","        }"],"startLine":109}